          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlakweemaá múk Yuda kaa gooín ar kalaámuú muqsli, kaa gooín ar parhhamtá miisli ar afa ngwáts, baraá muner'íní ale, nee gawaá xareemaá kiteeri'ín kudá' ta ilahhooár wa hanmaamisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár muk'ín bar kiteeri'ín kudaá ilahhooa gi inslasláy, nee munguúín kuduú /ameeni ta bay Ashera, kudá' taa qaás dír umuúqo xa'anoó naa/a, nee gawaá gongoama', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee gawaá sagér tlom'iiwo, nee xatsoowo. Aníng daqaari'iimarhúng, nee umuúqo gár ta koonda'a an haasaáng wa haniís dír wakuuserhúng, as tawa bu'uutuú tlakweemaahúng kudá' taa tlehhaahhité' baraá yaamu sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuuká' aníng naa kuungá' i haniís aqo in geexeerá', nee aníng kuungá' nun gawaá dabaá wakuuserhúng i haniís, as kiwa sagadiyuusa' baraá yaamaá kuungá' ta baloó xua'aaká, asma aníng an daa/atúw buhhtaawo adór asltá baloó gwa'aaká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
