    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ina báy, «Tláw, sihhiít dír afkuduú waawituú Yuda ir daraahi nee ir ti'imiiti baraá gixsaro, nee dír afe sleémeero ar gixsár Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ta o', ‹Kuungaá waawituú Yuda axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iiárií qaasaak, nee kuungá' múk Yuda nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu sleémeero, kudá' daaraahá' ar afeerí.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Bar amohhooár slafingwhúng a sla'á', ti haramagahhe', hee huwa mingiwa gagaár deelór Sabaátoro, nee mingiwa dahaás ar afér gixsár Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee deelór Sabaátoro huwa mar ti'iitaara' nee gadiyeé tam ar niiná ma kwatiitara'. Deelór Sabaáto boo/eesaak adór deelór hhoohhoo', adoodá' ngira qaroó oó' dír baabi'iihúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala baabi'iihúng aníng iga iiárií qaasi'iiká nee iga hhasliti'iiká, ala inooín sager'ín ngina gawdeesiyé', tidá' naa oó' ngina si'iyé', nee intsaahhasar'eé' ilaooharo gina si'iyé'.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Ala barnaxes aníng iga iiárií qasé', nee huwa ngi dahmisa'aaká baraá gixsa baalaarír Sabaátoro, ala deelór Sabaáto kari hhohhoesé', nee gadiyeedu kiri meeré' baalaadae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daqaní waawitaádá' waawuti'iima gaa oh alaá waawutmo Daudiwo, nee geeraharuusér hatlae, dinkwa nee múk Yuda, nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu, i dahiyá' ar afkú gixsarí, qoomár bar farsuuín ngwa i tsa/ané', nee gaardaá faras. Gixsarí kari hotaatín ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu ni hardah amór gixsadaá Yuda wa alé, nee ayeemaá Yerusalemu ngaa harweeriye', múk yaamaá Benyaminír daáhh, nee oo yaamaá Shefela, nee oo yaamaá tlom'i gi daáhh, nee oo Negebu as ilahhooár da/a ngiwa huwiya', nee ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i, nee ilahhooár bu'uungw, nee mooyángw tsuú' dinkwa nee ilahhooár sluufaay. Muruuwí sleémeero kungun huuw baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes kuungá' aníng iga iiárií qasi'iiká, nee deelór hhoohhoo' ar Sabaáto bar aga harmagahhi'iiká, nee huwa loohisooro aga meeri'iiká, nee kawa ar darta ar afér gixsár Yerusalemu bál deelór Sabaátoro, naagáy, aníng afér gixsár Yerusalemu a ásltí oohiís, nee maraá waawitá sleémeero kudá' baraá Yerusalemu giri /ák, nee heé asltadá' gaasaro ga aleesláw i kaahh.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
